WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
Now there is blood disaster

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,360
The food supply of the people in the whole city has reached the bottom.

3
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:06,120
I order you to immediately hand over the method of catching hares.

4
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,920
To relieve the urgent needs of the people in the city

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,240
Why should I tell you?

6
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,040
I came up with this method

7
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:12,600
Aren’t there a lot of you?

8
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,000
If you want to eat meat, you can catch it yourself

9
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:17,720
Be bold, little bastard, you are tired of living.

10
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:23,020
Shitou, don't be so impulsive as it could lead to death. Let me come to Mouchuan.

11
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,580
I'll ask you again

12
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,940
Is this method a blind eye?

13
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:28,540
Looking at the people in the city

14
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,020
Starve to death?

15
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,260
Lord Sun is right

16
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:33,740
Mou Chuan, you just want to devour those hares for yourself

17
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:37,710
There is no way you can tear him apart.

18
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:42,000
Mou Chuan, just bow your head and become soft, the worse you will be.

19
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:49,230
This lady will feel happier.

20
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:51,030
It's written on it. Read it yourself.

21
00:00:52,410 --> 00:00:53,690
If you dare to play tricks
